      "title": "MBSR Orienting ANOVA",
      "excerpt": "At Time 2, an ANOVA for the RT difference scores of the orienting component revealed a significant factor of group [F(2,48) = 10.13, p < .001]. Planned contrasts showed that the MBSR group differed from the control group (Bonferroni-adjusted p = .046) and the retreat group (Bonferroni-adjusted p < .001), while the retreat and control groups did not differ.",
